<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Proposal</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#ECECEF;font-family:Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#141418}
.page{width:816px;min-height:1056px;margin:0 auto;background:#fff;padding:64px 72px;box-sizing:border-box;position:relative}
.kicker{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;font-weight:700;color:#6B6B76;margin-bottom:6px}
.bar{width:44px;height:4px;background:{{brand.color|#141418}};border-radius:2px;margin-bottom:18px}
h1{font-size:34px;line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 8px;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.meta{font-size:13px;color:#6B6B76;margin-bottom:22px}
.note{font-size:12px;font-style:italic;color:#6B6B76;margin-bottom:14px}
h2{font-size:17px;margin:22px 0 8px;letter-spacing:-.01em}
p,li{font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;margin:0 0 8px}
ol,ul{padding-left:20px;margin:0 0 8px}ul.check{list-style:none;padding-left:0}ul.check li:before{content:"\2610  ";color:#6B6B76}
table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:4px 0 8px}th{background:#F2F2F5;color:#6B6B76;font-size:11px;text-align:left;letter-spacing:.04em}
th,td{border:1px solid #D9D9DE;padding:8px 10px;font-size:13px;vertical-align:top}
.foot{position:absolute;left:72px;right:72px;bottom:36px;font-size:11px;color:#6B6B76;border-top:1px solid #E5E5EA;padding-top:10px}</style></head><body><div class="page"><div class="kicker">PROPOSAL</div><div class="bar"></div><h1>Proposal for [Client name]</h1><div class="meta">Prepared by {{owner.first}} at {{business.name}}  ·  {{today}}</div><h2>What you told us</h2><p>[Two or three sentences in the client&#x27;s own words: where things are today and what they want instead. Use what they said on the call.]</p><h2>What we will do</h2><ol><li>[Step one: what you do first and what they get from it.]</li><li>[Step two.]</li><li>[Step three: how you hand it over.]</li></ol><h2>What is included</h2><table><tr><th>Included</th><th>Not included</th></tr><tr><td>[Item]</td><td>[Item]</td></tr><tr><td>[Item]</td><td>[Item]</td></tr><tr><td>[Item]</td><td>[Item]</td></tr></table><h2>Timeline</h2><table><tr><th>Milestone</th><th>Date</th></tr><tr><td>Kickoff</td><td>[Date]</td></tr><tr><td>[First milestone]</td><td>[Date]</td></tr><tr><td>Handover</td><td>[Date]</td></tr></table><h2>Options</h2><table><tr><th>Option</th><th>What is in it</th><th>Price</th></tr><tr><td>Essential</td><td>[The core result]</td><td>[Price]</td></tr><tr><td>Recommended</td><td>[Core plus the part that saves them the most time]</td><td>{{business.price}}</td></tr><tr><td>Complete</td><td>[Everything, done for them]</td><td>[Price]</td></tr></table><p>Prices are valid until [date].</p><h2>Why {{business.name}}</h2><p>[One or two real reasons: how you work, a result you have actually delivered, or a real client quote with permission. Leave this out if you are new.]</p><h2>Next step</h2><p>Reply to this email with the option you want, or book a time to talk it through: {{links.booking}}</p><div class="foot">{{business.name}}  ·  {{contact.email}}  ·  {{contact.phone}}  ·  {{links.website}}</div></div></body></html>